DESCRIPTION:Meditation + Museum exhibits\nhttps://luma.com/criticalteatheo
 ry\n\nJoin interdisciplinary artist and critical theorist Kelsey Chen (St
 anford) for an experimental lecture and tea service at tiat. The session 
 considers 'Chinamaxxing' as an expression of the search for alternative e
 pistemologies and a political critique of failing American institutions. 
 The programme focuses on Gongfu tea and 'Gongfu Uncles' as a lens to expl
 ore tactical and philosophical approaches
